{
 "doc": "M4-C10-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch10_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): Reedhollow, the Kirru village, at the overcast dusk (colour script ch10). A reed causeway from Ossa Fen (west, Gate) to a ring of platforms round the lagoon, reed houses off the ring, and the shore on its east side (Shore, ClutchStone) where the clutch stands for the farewell-tide and the motes lift. Pell is not let in (act_outline Ch10). The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C10-01).",
